Lets skate-host report the trick line in progress (trick name, line score,
multiplier, whether it is still building) so the addon can draw a score HUD.
Applied on top of chasmlol/2010-rust-rewrite-mashup at f608f85 by
native/patch-engine.sh until the change lands upstream. Same license as the
file it changes (Apache-2.0).

